{"id":"d74959af0b3e01fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product.md","title":"ZFC PCF Scale In Product","display":"df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product — ZFC PCF Scale In Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product — ZFC PCF Scale In Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier]]","[[../batch09/58-df-range.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf-scale-in-product — ZFC PCF Scale In Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"18c8c81ab92a8a3c\" href=\"?note=18c8c81ab92a8a3c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal\">58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" href=\"?note=3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier\">58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"44d32dc8fecf5e62\" href=\"?note=44d32dc8fecf5e62\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-range.md\">../batch09/58-df-range.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\lambda,I,J,\\theta,P,g,h\\in V\">\\(f,\\lambda,I,J,\\theta,P,g,h\\in V\\)</span> (scale, regular-cardinal sequence, product carrier, ideal, and length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfScaleInProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfScaleInProduct}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (fully parameterized order modulo an ideal, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"18c8c81ab92a8a3c\" href=\"?note=18c8c81ab92a8a3c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal\">58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S\\)</span> (dependent-product carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" href=\"?note=3dc4b831bf6ebd98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier\">58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (range operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"44d32dc8fecf5e62\" href=\"?note=44d32dc8fecf5e62\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-range.md\">../batch09/58-df-range.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(g,h,P,I,J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\ng,h\\in P\\land\n\\{i\\in I\\mid g(i)\\geq h(i)\\}\\in J\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(g,h,P,I,J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\ng,h\\in P\\land\n\\{i\\in I\\mid g(i)\\geq h(i)\\}\\in J\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}scale\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfScaleInProduct}_S(f,\\lambda,I,J,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\lambda,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda(i))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S(\\lambda(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(I))\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S(P,I,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,P)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\theta\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(f(\\alpha),f(\\beta),P,I,J))\\land\n\\forall g\\in P\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(g,f(\\alpha),P,I,J)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}scale\\text{-}in\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfScaleInProduct}_S(f,\\lambda,I,J,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\lambda,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda(i))\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S(\\lambda(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(I))\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard7RegularOrdinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ProductFamilyCarrier}_S(P,I,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\theta,P)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\theta\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(f(\\alpha),f(\\beta),P,I,J))\\land\n\\forall g\\in P\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\mathrm{PcfLess}_S(g,f(\\alpha),P,I,J)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product carrier is the registered dependent-function product. The order modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> carries the product, index set, and ideal as explicit arguments, so it cannot silently inherit unrelated free parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"18c8c81ab92a8a3c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card7-regular-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-product-family-carrier","status":"resolved","id":"3dc4b831bf6ebd98","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"